    "Apple encrypts and re-signs App Store apps, so there's no standard way to confirm a download was built from our public source.": {
      "comment": "Claim 15 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md. App Store is Apple's name. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple verschlüsselt App-Store-Apps und signiert sie neu. Daher gibt es keinen Standardweg, um zu bestätigen, dass ein Download aus unserem öffentlichen Quellcode erstellt wurde."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple cifra y vuelve a firmar las apps del App Store, así que no hay una forma estándar de confirmar que una descarga se compiló a partir de nuestro código fuente público."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple chiffre et signe à nouveau les apps de l’App Store : il n’existe donc aucun moyen standard de confirmer qu’un téléchargement a été compilé à partir de notre code source public."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple cifra e firma di nuovo le app dell’App Store, quindi non esiste un modo standard per confermare che un download sia stato compilato dal nostro codice sorgente pubblico."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "AppleはApp Storeのアプリを暗号化して再署名するため、ダウンロードしたアプリが公開ソースコードからビルドされたことを確認する標準的な方法はありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple은 App Store 앱을 암호화하고 다시 서명하므로, 다운로드한 앱이 공개 소스 코드로 빌드되었는지 확인할 표준 방법이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple versleutelt apps uit de App Store en ondertekent ze opnieuw, dus er is geen standaardmanier om te bevestigen dat een download uit onze openbare broncode is gebouwd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A Apple criptografa e assina novamente os apps da App Store, então não há uma forma padrão de confirmar que um download foi compilado a partir do nosso código-fonte público."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple 会加密并重新签名 App Store 中的 App，因此没有标准方法能确认下载的 App 是由我们公开的源代码构建而成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Apple 會加密並重新簽署 App Store 中的 App，因此沒有標準方法能確認下載的 App 是由我們公開的原始碼建置而成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
