    "Lets anyone check that the photo hasn't changed since nope. saved it. If off, the photo can't be checked for changes.": {
      "comment": "Explains the signing switch. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. Must not claim more than the English: the signature shows changes, it doesn't prove who took the photo. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit kann jeder prüfen, dass das Foto seit dem Sichern durch nope. nicht verändert wurde. Wenn aus, lässt sich nicht prüfen, ob das Foto verändert wurde."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permite a cualquiera comprobar que la foto no ha cambiado desde que nope. la guardó. Si se desactiva, no se puede comprobar si la foto ha cambiado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permet à chacun de vérifier que la photo n’a pas changé depuis que nope. l’a enregistrée. Désactivé, on ne peut pas vérifier si la photo a changé."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Consente a chiunque di verificare che la foto non sia cambiata da quando nope. l’ha salvata. Se disattivato, non è possibile verificare se la foto è cambiata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope. が保存してから写真が変更されていないことを、誰でも確認できます。オフにすると、変更の有無を確認できません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "nope.가 저장한 이후 사진이 변경되지 않았는지 누구나 확인할 수 있습니다. 끄면 사진의 변경 여부를 확인할 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Iedereen kan controleren dat de foto niet is veranderd sinds nope. hem bewaarde. Als dit uit staat, kan niet worden gecontroleerd of de foto is veranderd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Permite que qualquer pessoa verifique se a foto não mudou desde que o nope. a salvou. Se desativado, não é possível verificar se a foto mudou."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "让任何人都能确认照片自 nope. 存储后未被更改。关闭后，就无法检查照片是否被更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "讓任何人都能確認照片自 nope. 儲存後未經更改。關閉後，就無法檢查照片是否經過更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
