    "No contrast curve: closest to the sensor, so it looks flat and low in contrast.": {
      "comment": "Explains the Flat look. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Keine Kontrastkurve: am nächsten am Sensor, daher wirkt es flach und kontrastarm."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sin curva de contraste: lo más cercano al sensor, por eso se ve plano y con poco contraste."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aucune courbe de contraste : au plus près du capteur, l’image paraît plate et peu contrastée."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Nessuna curva di contrasto: il più vicino al sensore, quindi appare piatto e poco contrastato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "コントラストカーブなし：センサーに最も近く、平坦でコントラストが低く見えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "대비 커브 없음: 센서에 가장 가까워 평평하고 대비가 낮게 보입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Geen contrastkromme: het dichtst bij de sensor, dus het ziet er vlak en contrastarm uit."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sem curva de contraste: o mais próximo do sensor, por isso parece plano e com pouco contraste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "不应用对比度曲线：最接近传感器，因此看起来平淡、对比度低。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "不套用對比曲線：最接近感光元件，因此看起來平淡、對比度低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not saved: nope. couldn't confirm that the photo holds only the details you chose.": {
      "comment": "Shown when a finished photo file contained a metadata detail that is not on the privacy list, or couldn't be checked, so the app saved nothing. Honesty and privacy wording. Keep the name nope. unchanged, lowercase with its period.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Nicht gesichert: nope. konnte nicht bestätigen, dass das Foto nur die von dir gewählten Angaben enthält."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "No se guardó: nope. no pudo confirmar que la foto contiene solo los datos que elegiste."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Non enregistrée : nope. n’a pas pu confirmer que la photo ne contient que les informations que vous avez choisies."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Non salvata: nope. non è riuscito a confermare che la foto contenga solo i dati che hai scelto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "保存されませんでした：写真に選択した情報だけが含まれていることを nope. が確認できませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "저장되지 않음: 사진에 선택한 정보만 포함되어 있는지 nope.가 확인할 수 없었습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Niet bewaard: nope. kon niet bevestigen dat de foto alleen de gegevens bevat die je hebt gekozen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Não salva: nope. não conseguiu confirmar que a foto contém só os dados que você escolheu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "未存储：nope. 无法确认照片只包含你选择的信息。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "未儲存：nope. 無法確認照片只包含你選擇的資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: Photos sorts it by the date it was saved instead.": {
