    },
    "One overall tone curve, so the photo looks normal.": {
      "comment": "Explains the Standard look: a single global tone curve, nothing local. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
