    "Photos may privately compare landmark regions with Apple's servers (Enhanced Visual Search). You can turn it off in Settings › Apps › Photos.": {
      "comment": "Claim 10 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md. Keep \"may\": it is not verified whether it is on by default. Use the names iOS shows in this language. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Fotos kann Bildbereiche mit Sehenswürdigkeiten vertraulich mit Apples Servern abgleichen (Erweiterte visuelle Suche). Du kannst das unter Einstellungen › Apps › Fotos ausschalten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Fotos puede comparar de forma privada regiones con lugares de interés con los servidores de Apple (Búsqueda visual mejorada). Puedes desactivarlo en Ajustes › Apps › Fotos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Photos peut comparer de façon confidentielle des zones contenant des lieux connus avec les serveurs d’Apple (Recherche visuelle améliorée). Vous pouvez la désactiver dans Réglages › Apps › Photos."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Foto può confrontare in modo privato le aree con punti di interesse con i server di Apple (Ricerca visiva avanzata). Puoi disattivarla in Impostazioni › App › Foto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "写真アプリは、ランドマークと思われる領域をAppleのサーバとプライベートに照合することがあります（拡張画像検索）。設定 › アプリ › 写真でオフにできます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진 앱은 랜드마크 영역을 Apple 서버와 비공개로 비교할 수 있습니다(향상된 시각 검색). 설정 › 앱 › 사진에서 끌 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Foto’s kan gebieden met bezienswaardigheden privé vergelijken met de servers van Apple (verbeterde visuele zoekfunctie). Je kunt dit uitzetten via Instellingen › Apps › Foto’s."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O app Fotos pode comparar de forma privada regiões com pontos de referência com os servidores da Apple (Pesquisa Visual Aprimorada). Você pode desativar em Ajustes › Apps › Fotos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "“照片”可能会以私密方式将地标区域与 Apple 服务器进行比对（增强视觉搜索）。你可以在“设置”›“App”›“照片”中关闭此功能。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "「照片」可能會以私密方式將地標區域與 Apple 伺服器進行比對（增強視覺搜尋）。你可以在「設定」›「App」›「照片」中關閉此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos uses on-device analysis to recognize people and pets and to classify scenes. Names you give people sync through iCloud.": {
      "comment": "Claim 13 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md, Apple's own wording. Photos and iCloud are Apple's names. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Fotos nutzt Analysen auf dem Gerät, um Personen und Haustiere zu erkennen und Szenen zu klassifizieren. Namen, die du Personen gibst, werden über iCloud synchronisiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Fotos usa el análisis en el dispositivo para reconocer personas y mascotas y clasificar escenas. Los nombres que pones a las personas se sincronizan a través de iCloud."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Photos utilise une analyse sur l’appareil pour reconnaître les personnes et les animaux et classer les scènes. Les noms que vous donnez aux personnes sont synchronisés via iCloud."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Foto usa l’analisi sul dispositivo per riconoscere persone e animali domestici e classificare le scene. I nomi che assegni alle persone vengono sincronizzati tramite iCloud."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "写真アプリは、デバイス上の解析によって人物やペットを認識し、シーンを分類します。人物に付けた名前はiCloudを通じて同期されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진 앱은 기기 내 분석을 사용하여 사람과 반려동물을 인식하고 장면을 분류합니다. 사람에게 지정한 이름은 iCloud를 통해 동기화됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Foto’s gebruikt analyse op het apparaat om personen en huisdieren te herkennen en scènes te classificeren. Namen die je aan personen geeft, worden via iCloud gesynchroniseerd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O app Fotos usa análise no dispositivo para reconhecer pessoas e animais de estimação e classificar cenas. Os nomes que você dá às pessoas são sincronizados pelo iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "“照片”会使用设备上的分析来识别人物和宠物，并对场景分类。你为人物取的名称会通过 iCloud 同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "「照片」會使用裝置上的分析來辨識人物與寵物，並將場景分類。你為人物取的名稱會透過 iCloud 同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
