    "Shutter speed, ISO, aperture and focal length. Off: you can't see later how the photo was taken.": {
      "comment": "What the exposure settings are, and what turning them off costs. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Verschlusszeit, ISO, Blende und Brennweite. Aus: Du kannst später nicht sehen, wie das Foto aufgenommen wurde."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Velocidad de obturación, ISO, apertura y distancia focal. Desactivado: no podrás ver después cómo se tomó la foto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
