    "Tells editors which pixels are red, green and blue. Without it, the RAW has no color.": {
      "comment": "Why the color filter pattern is always saved. RAW is a file format name. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sagt Editoren, welche Pixel rot, grün und blau sind. Ohne diese Angabe hat das RAW keine Farbe."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Indica a los editores qué píxeles son rojos, verdes y azules. Sin esto, el RAW no tiene color."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Indique aux éditeurs quels pixels sont rouges, verts et bleus. Sans cela, le RAW n’a pas de couleur."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Indica agli editor quali pixel sono rossi, verdi e blu. Senza questo dato, il RAW non ha colore."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "どのピクセルが赤・緑・青かを編集アプリに伝えます。これがないと、RAWに色がなくなります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "어떤 픽셀이 빨강, 초록, 파랑인지 편집기에 알려 줍니다. 이 정보가 없으면 RAW에 색상이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vertelt editors welke pixels rood, groen en blauw zijn. Zonder dit heeft de RAW geen kleur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Informa aos editores quais pixels são vermelhos, verdes e azuis. Sem isso, o RAW fica sem cor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "告诉编辑器哪些像素是红、绿、蓝。缺少此信息，RAW 就没有颜色。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "告訴編輯器哪些像素是紅、綠、藍。缺少此資訊，RAW 就沒有色彩。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The HEIF and JPEG look in Settings changes only the copies nope. develops from the RAW. The RAW itself is never changed by it.": {
      "comment": "Keep \"nope.\" unchanged. RAW, HEIF and JPEG are file format names. Must not claim more than the English. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Der HEIF- und JPEG-Look in den Einstellungen ändert nur die Kopien, die nope. aus dem RAW entwickelt. Das RAW selbst wird dadurch nie verändert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El aspecto de HEIF y JPEG en Ajustes solo cambia las copias que nope. revela a partir del RAW. El RAW en sí nunca se modifica."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le rendu HEIF et JPEG dans les réglages ne modifie que les copies que nope. développe à partir du RAW. Le RAW lui-même n’est jamais modifié."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "L’aspetto di HEIF e JPEG nelle impostazioni cambia solo le copie che nope. sviluppa dal RAW. Il RAW stesso non viene mai modificato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "設定の「HEIFとJPEGの仕上がり」で変わるのは、nope. がRAWから現像するコピーだけです。RAW自体がこれによって変更されることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "설정의 HEIF 및 JPEG 룩은 nope.가 RAW에서 현상하는 사본만 바꿉니다. RAW 자체는 이로 인해 절대 변경되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De HEIF- en JPEG-weergave in Instellingen wijzigt alleen de kopieën die nope. uit de RAW ontwikkelt. De RAW zelf wordt er nooit door gewijzigd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A aparência de HEIF e JPEG nos Ajustes muda apenas as cópias que o nope. revela a partir do RAW. O próprio RAW nunca é alterado por ela."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "设置中的“HEIF 和 JPEG 风格”只会更改 nope. 从 RAW 冲印出的副本。RAW 本身永远不会因此被更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "設定中的「HEIF 與 JPEG 風格」只會變更 nope. 從 RAW 沖印出的副本。RAW 本身永遠不會因此被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
