    "When you share from Photos, location is included unless you turn it off under Options. Other details, such as the date and device model, may still be sent.": {
      "comment": "Claim 14 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md. Options is Apple's button name in the share sheet: use the name iOS shows in this language. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Wenn du aus Fotos teilst, ist der Standort enthalten, außer du schaltest ihn unter „Optionen“ aus. Andere Angaben, etwa das Datum und das Gerätemodell, können trotzdem gesendet werden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cuando compartes desde Fotos, la ubicación se incluye a menos que la desactives en Opciones. Otros datos, como la fecha y el modelo del dispositivo, pueden enviarse igualmente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Lorsque vous partagez depuis Photos, la position est incluse sauf si vous la désactivez dans Options. D’autres détails, comme la date et le modèle de l’appareil, peuvent quand même être envoyés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Quando condividi da Foto, la posizione è inclusa a meno che non la disattivi in Opzioni. Altri dettagli, come la data e il modello del dispositivo, possono comunque essere inviati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "写真アプリから共有すると、「オプション」でオフにしない限り位置情報が含まれます。日付やデバイスの機種などのその他の情報は、それでも送信される場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진 앱에서 공유하면 옵션에서 끄지 않는 한 위치가 포함됩니다. 날짜 및 기기 모델 같은 다른 정보는 그래도 전송될 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Als je deelt vanuit Foto’s, wordt de locatie meegestuurd tenzij je die uitzet onder Opties. Andere gegevens, zoals de datum en het apparaatmodel, kunnen nog steeds worden verstuurd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Quando você compartilha pelo Fotos, a localização é incluída, a menos que você a desative em Opções. Outros detalhes, como a data e o modelo do dispositivo, ainda podem ser enviados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "从“照片”共享时，除非你在“选项”中关闭，否则会包含位置。其他信息（例如日期和设备型号）仍可能会被发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "從「照片」分享時，除非你在「選項」中關閉，否則會包含位置。其他資訊（例如日期和裝置型號）仍可能會傳送出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With standard protection, Apple holds the keys to iCloud Photos. With Advanced Data Protection, only your devices do. Some photo metadata and Shared Albums stay under standard protection.": {
      "comment": "Claim 11 in docs/research/privacy-claims.md. Advanced Data Protection and Shared Albums are Apple's names: use the names iOS shows in this language. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Beim Standardschutz hat Apple die Schlüssel zu iCloud-Fotos. Mit dem erweiterten Datenschutz haben nur deine Geräte sie. Einige Fotometadaten und geteilte Alben bleiben unter dem Standardschutz."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con la protección estándar, Apple tiene las claves de Fotos de iCloud. Con la Protección de datos avanzada, solo las tienen tus dispositivos. Algunos metadatos de fotos y los Álbumes compartidos siguen con la protección estándar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Avec la protection standard, Apple détient les clés de Photos iCloud. Avec la Protection avancée des données, seuls vos appareils les détiennent. Certaines métadonnées des photos et les Albums partagés restent sous la protection standard."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con la protezione standard, Apple detiene le chiavi di Foto di iCloud. Con la Protezione avanzata dei dati, solo i tuoi dispositivi le detengono. Alcuni metadati delle foto e gli Album condivisi restano con la protezione standard."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "標準のデータ保護では、iCloud写真の鍵はAppleが保持します。高度なデータ保護では、鍵を持つのはあなたのデバイスだけです。一部の写真のメタデータと共有アルバムは標準のデータ保護のままです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "표준 보호에서는 Apple이 iCloud 사진의 키를 보유합니다. 고급 데이터 보호에서는 사용자의 기기만 키를 보유합니다. 일부 사진 메타데이터와 공유 앨범은 표준 보호로 유지됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Met standaardbeveiliging beheert Apple de sleutels van iCloud-foto’s. Met geavanceerde gegevensbescherming hebben alleen je apparaten ze. Sommige fotometagegevens en gedeelde albums blijven onder standaardbeveiliging."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Com a proteção padrão, a Apple guarda as chaves das Fotos do iCloud. Com a Proteção Avançada de Dados, somente seus dispositivos as guardam. Alguns metadados de fotos e os Álbuns Compartilhados continuam com a proteção padrão."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "采用标准保护时，Apple 持有“iCloud 照片”的密钥。采用“高级数据保护”时，只有你的设备持有密钥。部分照片元数据和“共享相簿”仍采用标准保护。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "採用標準保護時，Apple 持有「iCloud 照片」的密鑰。採用「進階資料保護」時，只有你的裝置持有密鑰。部分照片後設資料和「共享相簿」仍採用標準保護。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, colors look washed out or oversaturated.": {
      "comment": "Why the color profile is always saved. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ohne diese Angabe wirken Farben blass oder übersättigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sin esto, los colores se ven apagados o sobresaturados."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sans cela, les couleurs paraissent délavées ou sursaturées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Senza questo dato, i colori appaiono sbiaditi o ipersaturi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これがないと、色がくすんだり、彩度が高すぎたりします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 정보가 없으면 색상이 흐리거나 과포화되어 보입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zonder dit zien kleuren er flets of oververzadigd uit."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sem isso, as cores parecem desbotadas ou supersaturadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少此信息，颜色会显得暗淡或过度饱和。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少此資訊，色彩會顯得黯淡或過度飽和。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, the file can't be read at all.": {
      "comment": "Why the image size and layout are always saved. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ohne diese Angabe lässt sich die Datei gar nicht lesen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sin esto, el archivo no se puede leer en absoluto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sans cela, le fichier est totalement illisible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Senza questo dato, il file non può essere letto affatto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これがないと、ファイルをまったく読み込めません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 정보가 없으면 파일을 전혀 읽을 수 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zonder dit kan het bestand helemaal niet worden gelezen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sem isso, o arquivo não pode ser lido de forma alguma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少此信息，文件完全无法读取。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "缺少此資訊，檔案完全無法讀取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without it, the photo shows sideways or upside down.": {
      "comment": "Why the orientation is always saved. Honesty wording: a fluent human must review every translation before release.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ohne diese Angabe wird das Foto seitlich oder kopfüber angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sin esto, la foto se muestra de lado o al revés."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Sans cela, la photo s’affiche de travers ou à l’envers."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Senza questo dato, la foto appare di lato o capovolta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これがないと、写真が横向きや逆さまに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 정보가 없으면 사진이 옆으로 누워 있거나 뒤집혀 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
